      "part_stem": "Two iterative formulae, $A$ and $B$, derived from this equation are as follows:\n$$x_{n+1} = (3x_n + 7)^{\\frac{1}{3}}, \\quad (A)$$\n$$x_{n+1} = \\frac{x_n^3 - 7}{3}. \\quad (B)$$\nEach formula is used with initial value $x_1 = 2.5$.",
